# Differential Practice (MeWorld game)

**Entry:** Welcome → Differentials · `Home.jsx` eager-imports `DifferentialPractice.jsx` (no lazy — CSS guard).

## Data sources (critical)

| What | Path | Used by |
|------|------|---------|
| **Clean LLM cases (canonical)** | `C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\data\cases\case_N.json` | Build only |
| **Differential review bank** | `game/src/data/differentialReview.json` | Case tab |
| **Practice cards** | `game/src/data/differentialBank.json` | Chief complaint + answer key |
| **Real-world stories** | `game/src/data/realWorldCases.json` | Real World tab |
| **Runtime play cases (thin)** | `game/data/cases/` + `preparedCases.json` | Play/Briefing only — **not** differential Case tab |

Rebuild review bank after clean JSON changes:
```powershell
Set-Location C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game
node scripts/build-differential-review.mjs
```
Or `npm run build:differential-review` (included in `build:data` / `predev`).

**Do not** parse `*_ocr.txt` for differential Case tab — use `case_N.json` via build script.

## Study panel tabs

`DifferentialStudyPanel.jsx` — three tabs:

1. **Timeline** — practice attempt history
2. **Case** — `DifferentialReviewPanel`: Case Summary + **numbered Orders** (1, 2, 3… workflow)
3. **Real World** — up to 2 curated patient stories + YouTube iframes + search fallback

## Patient names

- Templates use `{{patient_name}}` in clean JSON HPI.
- Runtime: `personalizeDifferentialReview()` in `src/lib/differentialReview.js`
- Name region from **Settings → audience profile** (`readAudienceProfile().nameRegion`)
- **Default region:** `mixed` (NYC / multicultural — one culture per case #)
- Also applies refined HPI from `narrativeRefine.js` when user has agreed refined narrative saved.

## UI conventions

- Chief complaint: **2 lines** — complaint + specialty/setting (`splitChiefComplaintHeadline`)
- ICU ambience: `unlockAmbience` + `startIcuMonitor` on enter; volume control **fixed bottom-right**, no border box (`.diff-ambience-dock`)
- Orders: structured list with gold step numbers — not `[OK]` text blocks
- CSS: `src/styles/differential-practice.css` — audit via `scripts/audit-component-css.mjs`

## Real World tab — Gemini + Google Search (primary)

On tab open: `POST /api/differential/real-world` → `server/geminiRealWorld.js`

- Requires **`GEMINI_API_KEY`** in `MeWorld/.env` (Google AI Studio)
- Uses **`google_search`** tool (same capability as Gemini app with Google access)
- Caches per case: `game/.real-world-cache/case_N.json`
- Client: `src/lib/fetchGeminiRealWorld.js` · UI: `DifferentialRealWorldPanel.jsx`

**Curated fallback:** `src/data/realWorldCases.json` (caseId/diagnosis match only — no loose topic-only matches). Case 96: Alex Lewis + Lauren Wasser.

## Key files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `DifferentialPractice.jsx` | Main screen, stacker, scoring |
